# TLS Scanner Ignore File
#
# List deployment names to exclude from scanning, one per line.
# Lines starting with # are comments and will be ignored.
# Empty lines are also ignored.
#
# Format: namespace/deployment-name or just deployment-name
# Examples:
#   kube-system/coredns
#   monitoring-deployment
#   test-app

# Exclude test deployments
# test-deployment

# Exclude specific system components
# kube-system/kube-dns
